{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-08_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-08","title":"幻境迁流","storyCode":"13-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"419b6c956b248132da03b7eeee328aa48b2a101d0682ddafb52d5a163069cf31","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在......哪里......\n痛楚，撕扯，破碎。\n每一项苦难都加诸我身，每一个沉默着被杀死的人都是我自己。\n不，我得......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是，我为什么使不上力气？\n有人在呼唤我，语气好像很焦急......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是博士吗？我听不清楚。\n我想回应，我试图开口，我想告诉博士我没事。\n疼痛开始渐渐褪去，混乱的场景也终于变得清晰。\n我在寻找身体里的力量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_27"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我见诸城，满目疮痍。”\n“我见源石，遍布大地。”\n“我见你——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"模糊的回响远去，我睁开眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是，一片战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的战场，“魔王”的战场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"军阵沉默地在我的背后蛰伏，高高挑起的旗帜上，浸满了血、哀痛与往昔之苦。\n我们的......敌人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会为您拿下最后一座城市。他们的抵抗已经行至终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......食腐者王庭之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什么名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有名字，我只是您的属臣，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是您的命运，您为我们带来了救赎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们始终渴望的，我们终于达成的......救赎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我轻轻点了点头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呜咽声轰然奏响，喉管深处吐出毁灭之章，我脚下的土地因我而匍匐，因我而蜷缩。\n这是“魔王”带给这片大地的恩典。\n阵线开始前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意志，就是我们的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已回应预言，预言便会降下它的赏赐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请交给我们，这场战役不会拖延得太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"预言？\n预言。\n我曾经听过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这些天，你看起来很疲倦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，这样可不行，你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是吗？我......很疲倦？\n我们在城防军指挥塔上经历了艰难的一战，凯尔希医生受了重伤。\n诺伯特区被封锁，所有市民在其中等待死亡。\n我们被维多利亚的天灾洗礼......但我们的军队没有屈服。\n萨尔贡人的黄金之城中，长生军千年的嘶吼被我们钉死在棺木之中。\n崔林特尔梅的高塔腐坏崩解，金律之下，不得再奏响任何音符。\n永恒矗立的圣城拉特兰，洁白的教堂被黑色浸染，他们古老的背叛终于得以清算。\n就连海潮之下......傲慢的阿戈尔人也向我低下了他们的头颅。仍试图坚守尊严者，我一一将其收取。\n所有的场景中，都有一个相同的身影。\n......这些都是我做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些......都是我做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是你必须要去做的，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经来到了这一切的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我们命定的终点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我感觉眼眶之中，有什么正缓缓流出。\n特蕾西娅小姐温柔地抬起手，为我拭去泪痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，我把这顶冠冕亲自加诸你身，我为你带来了这些痛苦......与光荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会一起面对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......众魂的结论，我们不能违抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越拒绝，你就越痛苦；你越反抗，你就越无力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅小姐的面目模糊了起来。\n他们所有人，正同时向我诉说。\n万千年来，所有归于众魂的萨卡兹们，正同时向我诉说。\n没有斥责，没有恐怖。\n他们只是......纯粹地，希望我重得平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我们曾见过如此之多命运的反抗者，预言早早在他们的面前彰显，他们早已明晰，自己将倒毙于何处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我们感怀于那些无谓的挑战，这也许会织就英雄的史诗，但英雄本人，却注定沉沦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越拒绝，你就越痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你明白，所有的选择，所有的挣扎，所有的精疲力尽，咽下的悲哀，皆无意义。拒绝只会让命运的甘霖变得苦涩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越反抗，你就越无力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你发现，所有的斗争，所有的不屈，所有你我的血迹，枯槁的话语，皆无所去。反抗只会让注定的归宿填满荆棘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你又何必......你又何必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想，让你安眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上眼睛吧，阿米娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闭上眼睛吧。\n万千族裔，跪拜在我的锈色王座之下，他们将把卡兹戴尔背负至此。\n魔王鞭策他们，魔王驱使他们，魔王奴役他们。\n这是你的使命，这是我的使命。\n这是我......既定的命运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_16"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我......\n我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我低下头，我感知到了自己的手。我试着握了握拳。\n这是我的意志吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"旷远的战场上，我自己正孑然其中。\n数不尽的尸骸。\n黑色的王冠悬停在她的头顶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“我见你，头顶黑冠，将千万生灵，熬成回忆。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“我见魔王，将所有种群，尽数奴役。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你会后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你会像我一样后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的终点......仍是这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等到死亡来临，你会发现，所有预言，全部实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......是大地上最可怖的灾难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是大地上最可怖的灾难。\n我一步步地走向阿米娅，走向我自己。\n走向命运本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的法术编织成剑，刺穿了眼前的阿米娅。\n刺穿了我自己的胸膛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我会杀死你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕，你就是我，你就是“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾......和你做过相同的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾以为我已经足够强大，强大到足以挣脱命运的束缚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......你做不到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也许尝试过，你也许经历了一切的苦涩，终究还是发现自己落入相同的深渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有行过，你们说的，“注定的道路”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我决定向你们挑战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会向你们挑战，以我，魔王之名，“阿米娅”之名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一切的结局，早就被你们借预言的口吻编订成册，如果我们生命的全部意义，都只是证明你们的结论不可违逆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们为何还要生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们为何还要存在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那爱国者先生终其一生的抗争，凯尔希医生殚精竭虑的选择，Dr.{@nickname}每一次牵起我的手，坚定地与我同行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切只成了命运的注脚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝不承认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，这只会为你带来痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这只会是，无尽的折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的众魂，我质问你，特蕾西娅小姐是否打破了她的命运？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是特雷西斯，他是否也曾向你们迎头痛击？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐......她为此，把这顶王冠，交给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不相信你们描画的，注定可悲的未来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹众魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她现在饱受折磨......所以她现在无时无刻不在聆听我们的声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹众魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是为了免除她的痛苦，“魔王”，你也应该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐从不需要任何拯救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”也不会是征服和复仇的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许，才需要是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹众魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"多么自大，多么狂妄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，正因为我已戴起黑冠，我才会向你们挥剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹众魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"你无法逃过命运的选择。你越逃，就只会越快让它来到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就等在这里，“命运”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你们的一切筹谋消散，等到你们的一切嘲弄落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会让你们看见——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......这片大地上的人们，可以为自己选定结局。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我寻找到了身体里的力量。\n他们唤这种力量为，“魔王”。\n但我知道，“魔王”根本不是它的本意，这种力量不是为了征服、为了统御而存在。\n它的本意，是——\n“存续”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的战场轰然破碎。\n我听到了一声渺远的叹息。\n并不愤怒，并不惊恐，并不悲哀。\n仅是叹息。\n这到底是众魂于我的回应，还是......我自己从梦魇中醒来的呓语？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅，你醒了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"熟悉的声音，我感到那些缥缈的情绪正在消散。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身体上有什么不舒服的吗？\n你被赦罪师的巫术影响，你做噩梦了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士的声音总是让我安心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经没事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我抬起手，黑色的法术如往常一样闪烁而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，这份力量不会是诅咒，不会是带来灾难的禁忌巫术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐把它交给我，是为了......我们能用它找到自己的路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我相信你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士轻轻握了握我的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......Logos先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是不是赦罪师的巫术影响，我也许都迟早要面对这些......诘问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在梦里，那些声音再度向我宣告了预言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"预言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......爱国者先生死前说出的那个预言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是什么声音，都是赦罪师的无聊把戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必当真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这究竟是赦罪师的拷问手法，还是众魂依然在连接着我的内心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是我自己......一直把那个可怕的预言记在心底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不重要，我已经拒绝了他们的邀请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我仍希望你接受凯尔希医生的全面检查。你的戒指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不过Logos先生，我们这是在......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处有脚步声传来，那是......几个萨卡兹雇佣兵？他们正搬运着一枚带着血色的结晶碎片，装上不远处的货车。\n我认识领头的那个女孩，明椒。听博士说，她放过了海布里区的工人们。\nLogos征用了这支萨卡兹运输小队的车辆。用女妖之主的身份。\n我们需要躲过赦罪师的追踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天，可露希尔的无人机找到了我们，他们之前停留的W的安全屋也遭到了赦罪师的袭击，夜莺被赦罪师带走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赦罪师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们对这支以赦罪师为名的萨卡兹疏于防范。特雷西斯的计划也为他们提供了行动的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们终于走出了躲藏的阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，明椒他们正把你需要的源石样品装车，他们已经起了疑心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们现在只是畏惧我，才继续勉强执行我的命令，但恐怕很快，我就需要真正以咒术胁迫他们了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"五批结晶的样本，已经够了。阿米娅的状态也已经好转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，接下来，我们去布伦特伍德，与凯尔希医生会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看起来有些心神不宁......你在担心什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在担心特雷西斯想要的，根本不是什么血魔巫术装置。\n他想获得......更加让人不安的力量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅？"]}]}
